  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large mixing bowl, whisk together the mixed grain flours, shio-koji cure, maple syrup, coconut oil, almond milk, vegan egg replacer, baking powder, and salt.",
    "Stir in the shredded coconut, chopped fresh mint, dried cranberries, and orange zest.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a greased 9x9-inch baking dish and smooth the top.",
    "Bake for 35-40 minutes or until the edges are lightly golden brown.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for 10-15 minutes before serving."
  ],
